// Title: Dism Remove Online Package
// ID: 43e32da2-fdd0-4156-90de-50dfd62636f9
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-01-16
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Deployment Image Servicing and Management tool. DISM is used to enumerate, install, uninstall, configure, and update features and packages in Windows images
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.executable endswith "\\Dism.exe" and (process.command_line like "*_/Online*" and process.command_line like "*_/Disable-Feature*")) or (process.executable endswith "\\DismHost.exe" and (process.parent.command_line like "*_/Online*" and process.parent.command_line like "*_/Disable-Feature*")))
